  "body": "Unlock the ultimate opportunity on the Coast! Whether you are a savvy homeowner looking for a project or a developer hunting for your next big venture, 624 Whangaparaoa Road is the canvas you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nThis property offers a solid foundation for those with a vision. For the homeowner, this has massive potential to add value through renovation and reap the rewards of a prime location. For the developer, the site itself is a powerhouse of possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe home is a character-filled multi-level dwelling that offers a warm and inviting atmosphere. Inside, you'll find high-vaulted ceilings and expansive timber detailing that create a sense of space and rustic charm, anchored by a cozy wood-burning fireplace in the heart of the living area.\r\n\r\nThe functional kitchen, finished in a refreshing coastal palette, flows seamlessly into the open-plan dining and lounge areas, making it perfect for family life. Step outside to find impressive wrap-around decking and a large, sheltered courtyard-ideal for year-round entertaining. This is a home with \"good bones\" and a fantastic layout, just waiting for a modern touch to truly make it shine.\r\n\r\nThe potential for capital gain here is undeniable. Positioned close to local amenities, stunning beaches, and transport links, the location sells itself.\r\n________________________________________\r\n\r\nALL CONJUNCTIONALS WELCOME, so agents, bring your buyers! \r\n\r\nContact Ian 0211592078 today to find out more!\r\n\r\nVIEWING BY APPOINTMENT with 48 hours notice due to tenants.",
